version: "0.3.0"
date-released: "2025-05-27"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Any2Poster/Any2Poster"
url: "https://any2poster.github.io"
abstract: >
  Any2Poster is a universal academic poster generation system that accepts
  any input format (PDF, DOCX, PPTX, LaTeX, Markdown, Jupyter Notebook,
  HTML, and video) and produces a publication-quality poster using
  deterministic HTML/CSS text rendering via Playwright and a panel-level
  VLM feedback loop that closes the engagement gap identified in Paper2Poster.
keywords:
  - poster-generation
  - academic-poster
  - multi-agent
  - vision-language-models
  - benchmark
  - html-css
  - playwright
  - research-automation
